# WS6-02 (std.math edges). Sources: spec/appendix-stdlib.md §16 (256 steps per turn;
# results scaled by 256 in -256..=256; angles wrap every 256; cos(a) = sin(a + 64);
# sqrt is the integer floor and a negative input returns 0); spec/02 §10 (i32 `+` wraps,
# so big + 64 wraps). sin(-2147483648) is angle 0 mod 256.
# Expected: the three lines below on every profile and build line, no sanitizer report.
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: output
contrast: {sqrt(15)} ==> {sqrt(24)}
contrast-expect: output
--- output
0 256 0 -256 0 -256 0
true true true
0 0 1 3 4 46340
--- contrast-output
0 256 0 -256 0 -256 0
true true true
0 0 1 4 4 46340
